WEBVTT - Licence Saathi 3-Minute Demo Video Subtitles

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Applying for a driving licence can feel confusing, especially for a first-time applicant.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.500
Licence Saathi turns the journey into simple, guided steps.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Users can understand eligibility, prepare their documents and see exactly what to do next.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
The calculator shows exact rules for your vehicle class and age,

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:39.000
while the document checklist demystifies official requirements in plain words.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:48.000
The guided form saves progress and makes every step easier to understand.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:56.500
The application and payment are simulated,

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:04.500
giving first-time applicants complete confidence before they visit the actual portal.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:14.000
Interactive lessons, traffic signs and practice questions help applicants learn road safety before taking the learner's test.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:23.500
Every sign is an inline SVG, with text-to-speech audio and flip flashcards,

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:34.000
along with instant explanations and a 30-second countdown timer matching real RTO exams.

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:43.500
Users can prepare for test day and understand when they may apply for a permanent licence.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:54.000
The calendar-safe calculator tracks the mandatory 30-day waiting rule and 180-day expiry, with simulated RTO slot booking.

00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:02.000
Sample tracking makes application stages easier to understand.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:14.000
The assistant answers common questions and provides a local fallback, with strict privacy filters that refuse sensitive Aadhaar numbers.

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:24.000
Licence Saathi supports Hindi, accessible text sizes and mobile-first navigation for people using basic smartphones.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:34.500
Every element is tested at 360 pixels width with large typography and high contrast for bright sunlight readability.

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:42.000
After the first successful load, cached learning and journey features can continue working without an internet connection.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:49.500
The Progressive Web App ensures that unreliable 2G or 3G data never stops an applicant from preparing.

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:56.000
Licence Saathi makes the driving licence journey simpler, clearer and more accessible.

00:02:56.500 --> 00:03:00.000
It is a prototype using sample data, not an official government service.
